{"reviewId": "38291888_877D2jsDz", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "这往往是因为我们正处于衰退的早期阶段，或者是滞胀阶段的尾声。\n周金涛的理论提醒我们：能源消费看的是“过去投资的存量”，而经济衰退看的是“未来预期的增量”。 当增量预期已经转冷时，存量惯性还在支撑着物理世界的运转，这就造成了能源价格相对于经济基本面的滞后性。\n深入一点思考：\n你提到的这个规律，其实也是下一轮周期起点的伏笔。能源价格在高位维持越久，对下游生产国（如中国、德国）的成本挤压就越严重，这会加速经济探底。而当探底完成，能源价格因需求崩塌而暴跌后，又为下一轮复苏提供了低成本的空间。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "13906-13952", "abstract": "我们需要理解为什么经济衰退后依然会出现一定时期的能源价格上涨，这就存在能源消费的惯性规律问题", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "38291888_877D2jsDz", "userVid": 38291888, "topics": [], "createTime": 1771805512, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 38291888, "name": "N.Z.ɞ", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/wmTFH76LP2ibCQOH6l2BFicpC2vw6S6f4fxqXiaM8LYkrIIQS0TXmHgv83DIDvzy2fPBIoZQTLuNWicSxGYLNdkQ8ttYsOx5v5T3ibTic8TNx3ZDA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "N.Z.ɞ", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "🥃", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "🍏", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-200", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 200}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 98, "likes": [{"userVid": 291883477, "name": "Amy Mao", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/ygBibyM8xBCWQnuqGxLpdSq0G8Uxxno7WicHx4PXnc3pm16OuHbibXRuicAjoAC5a9ic9r8XXUvEd7YMEqYapL1rgRbJPoic0rvIn0SXl3u1RMDgE/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-100", "desc": "阅读